        <definition>typedef LLVMOrcObjectLayerRef( * LLVMOrcLLJITBuilderObjectLinkingLayerCreatorFunction) (void *Ctx, LLVMOrcExecutionSessionRef ES, const char *Triple)</definition>
        <argsstring>)(void *Ctx, LLVMOrcExecutionSessionRef ES, const char *Triple)</argsstring>
        <name>LLVMOrcLLJITBuilderObjectLinkingLayerCreatorFunction</name>
        <briefdescription>
<para>A function for constructing an ObjectLinkingLayer instance to be used by an LLJIT instance. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Clients can call LLVMOrcLLJITBuilderSetObjectLinkingLayerCreator to set the creator function to use when constructing an LLJIT instance. This can be used to override the default linking layer implementation that would otherwise be chosen by LLJITBuilder.</para>
<para>Object linking layers returned by this function will become owned by the LLJIT instance. The client is not responsible for managing their lifetimes after the function returns. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
